window.products.push({"id":757115,"name":"Self Adhesive Hooks. Vintage Real Wood Tree Branch. Rustic; Decorative Wooden Adhesive Hooks. Key Hangers, Coat Hooks (Large (3CM - 4CM), PlainO1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+2PzKCa0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Description Special focus and care has been taken on packaging processes and manufacturing procedures.  These branches are treated with multiple layers of food grade WAX and Shellac polish  These Small Tree Branch Wall Hooks are pretty unique holders and are derived from the branches of more than 7 various kinds of plant species .can be used for keys,  but these can also be used for lightweight jackets, curtains, kitchen towels, pot holders, jewelry, etc. If you have a nature inspired home, you will love this product! Feature - These have both decorative and functional value. No more hunting endlessly for keys. - Beautiful natural wood hooks that offer an earthy feel with a very utilitarian purpose. - Strong tackiness to adhere to the wall, perfect for Hanging hats, headphones, coats, jewelry or towels and gadgets, etc  - Great for rustic wood themed bedroom bathroom kitchen, a nice rustic and natural decorative product. - The item can work well on the surface of siding, ceramic tile, glass, refrigerators, washing machines and metal - They are about the same height but not the same thickness . Package Included: 4 x Adhesive Wall Hooks How to best paste the 3M VHB Hook: Step1: Please select the spot with care as these are pretty hard to remove once installed properly Step2: Properly remove any dust or moist from the point of installation. . Step3: Press it properly for 30 seconds and waiting couple of hours before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+2PzKCa0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craftiers","source_asin":"B09YQ96Q4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YQ96Q4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YQ96Q4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":757116,"name":"ICOFER 53mm Espresso Tamper Professional Barista Calibrated Coffee Tamper with 30lbs Spring Loaded, Stainless Steel Flat Base Aluminum Handle Tamper F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pYli654YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖Choose ICOFER Calibrated Tamper💖: Everyone who has ever made espresso should know that traditional coffee tampers are prone to skewing, and an unbalanced espresso tamper will ruin a perfect shot. ICOFER spring-loaded tamper avoids this problem and provides a consistent tamper angle during the tamping process to make your espresso even better. 💖Unique Design for Barista💖: ICOFER espresso tamper consists of 304 stainless steel tamper base, aluminum handle, and built-in double spring. The tamper is loaded with consistent tamping pressure by built-in dual springs and requires no additional adjustment. The handle is ergonomically designed to easily tamp the coffee powder. The appearance breaks the convention and adds three red rubber rings to bring you a unique aesthetic. 💖Consistent Pressure and Concentric Ring💖: The internal spring of this calibrated tamper controls the pressure you apply, delivering a consistent 30 lbs of pressure. With this espresso tamper, you'll get a flat, concentric ring pattern in your portafilter, saving time and delivering a great, consistent-tasting espresso. This espresso tool is the perfect partner for home baristas and busy cafes 💖Balance and Level Tamping💖: ICOFER coffee tamper is dedicated to solving the imbalance of coffee taste due to uneven coffee grounds. When you press the tamper, the horizontal block rests on the top of the portafilter basket, making sure that the base is level down to tamp the coffee grounds uniformly. There will be no more uneven tamping you will easily get a consistent espresso coffee. 💖High-quality Service💖: ICOFER not only provides you with high-quality products but also provides high-quality after-sales service. Our 51mm, 53mm, and 58.35mm calibration tamper is compatible with all sizes of flat bottomless mobile filters. And provide a one-year warranty. If at any point you find that you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us and we will refund 100% of the money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pYli654YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICOFER","source_asin":"B0B4S8Y9KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4S8Y9KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4S8Y9KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
