window.products.push({"id":757196,"name":"BCYOUP Dream Catcher, Handmade Dreamcatcher for Bedroom, Wall Hanging, Home Decor, Ornaments Craft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pbTIAnNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handcraft - All our dream catcher are woven by our hand workers with long expericences in knitting,so that the web will looks falt and evenly. Dream Catcher History & Legend Dream catchers are one of the most fascinating traditions of Native Americans, it comes from the 18th century. They believed that the night air is filled with dreams both good and bad. The traditional dream catcher was intended to protect the sleeping individual from negative dreams, while letting positive dreams through. The good dreams know how to pass through it, slipping through the holes and slide down the soft feathers tassels to the sleeping person. The negative dreams would get caught up in the web, and expire when the first rays of the sun struck them. Nice Dream Dream Catchers for Wall Hanging Home Decor Perfect hanging ornaments for your home decorative, especially like bedroom, living room, house, windows, office, balcony, wall art, etc. Can be used to decor children's room! This dream catcher will be the focus of any occassions, perfect for decorating the wall or gift for yourself, your family, children, friends etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pbTIAnNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BCYOUP","source_asin":"B08G7ZRTVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G7ZRTVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G7ZRTVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
