window.products.push({"id":757234,"name":"Hinomaru Collection 28 fl oz Authentic Japanese Minoyaki Porcelain Large 7.75\" Diameter Ramen Noodle Bowl Sky Blue Dragon Ryu Design Made in Japan (Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xY5J0wx9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Ramen has become one of Japan’s most well-known ambassadors. The popularity is fueled by the creative nature of today’s ramen scene and the perfect collision between tradition, art and innovation. As we savor and admire this culinary trend, we should take note that the bowl itself is just as important as what it contains. The vessel for ramen affects greatly the presentation of a well-crafted bowl of ramen. There are several characteristics that factor into whether a bowl is good or not so good; shape, style, material, weight, depth and design. The Hinomaru Collection of Ramen Bowls feature a wide range of ramen bowls crafted by artisans from Mino City, Gifu prefecture in Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xY5J0wx9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hinomaru Collection","source_asin":"B084TBL12F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084TBL12F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084TBL12F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
