window.products.push({"id":757385,"name":"Pasta Roller, Pasta Maker, Designed by Italy, Noodle Maker Machine with 2-in-1 Pasta Roller with Rollers and Cutter, 9 Adjustable Thickness Settings, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pa-RmITgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy and convenient to make Pasta】 Simplified the noodle making process, turning the crank arm by hand to make the roller press the noodles instead of traditional pressing method, convenient to get the delicious food with this commercial grade equipment, you can get that perfect fresh flavor and texture more often, including fettuccine, lasagne, linguine, spaghetti, vermicelli, angel hair, tagliatelle. 【Food-rade Material Type & Long-lasting】Material type of pasta rollers and pasta cutter are made of high-quality Nickel-Plated Steel, Chrome-Plated Steel, ABS and non-toxic aluminum alloy, thus guaranteeing its safety and durability; innovatively designed with a sturdy table clamp, it will not move around when in use.(Don't be washed in water or put in the dishwasher.) 【9 adjustable thickness settings】Pasta maker customized adjustment knob with 9 thickness dough roller settings allows you to choose the thickness at will, the thickest can reach 3.8 mm; Through this simple adjustment to change the texture and taste of the pasta. you can also get dumpling skins as thin as 0.6mm by continuously pressing the thickness of the dough! 【Free installation & Double Cutter Head】No need to install additional cutters. This pasta maker has a double cutter head attachment for you to choose your width preference, pasta sheets can be cut with one of 2 or 4 mm (0.07 in or 0.15 in), Whether you enjoy preparing for making spaghetti, fettuccini and more; caters to all your pasta making needs. 【Perfect Gift & Customer Service】Manual pasta maker is very suitable as a gift for friends. making fresh pasta is a very rewarding activity; Pasta maker machine is supplied with an English manual. we recommend you read the instructions before making the pasta, if you have any questions please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pa-RmITgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VTVTKK","source_asin":"B0BNPVD7MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNPVD7MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNPVD7MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
