window.products.push({"id":757563,"name":"TIVOLI Chef Knife Japanese 7-inch Santoku Knife Hand Forged VG10 High Carbon Steel Chef Knife Ultra Sharp Cutting Chopping Knife with Wooden Handle Kn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61daC0VbHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【VERSATILE KITCHEN KNIFE】This multi-functional santoku chef knife is perfect for your daily kitchen tasks of chopping, slicing, dicing, and mincing all kinds of meat, fish, vegetable, fruit. As kitchen essentials, our handmade knives are lighter and more flexible than traditional chef's knives. 【VERSATILE KITCHEN KNIFE】This multi-functional santoku chef knife is perfect for your daily kitchen tasks of chopping, slicing, dicing, and mincing all kinds of meat, fish, vegetable, fruit. As kitchen essentials, our handmade knives are lighter and more flexible than traditional chef's knives. 【VG-10 JAPANESE SUPER STEEL】Made of VG-10 high carbon stainless steel, TIVOLI cooking knives offer great edge retention, wear resistance, corrosion resistance, hardness and toughness. Our Japanese Knife is super durable and easy to resharpen with the attached sharpener. 【ERGONOMIC PAKKAWOOD HANDLE】The full tang handle of Asian knives is made of Pakkawood, a material that originates from Africa, and it is known for its comfort, strength, and stability. The handle fits perfectly in the palm of the hand and it provides excellent comfort and non-slip grip for your relaxing kitchen time. 【TIVOLI CARE FOR YOU】 TIVOLI focuses on making high-quality knives at an affordable price. We’re proud to say we believe in our blades. That’s why we offer 100% SATISFACTION and a lifetime warranty against quality defects. Come with an elegant gift box, it’s a wise gift choice for birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, and Halloween!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61daC0VbHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIVOLI","source_asin":"B0B17HYLY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B17HYLY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B17HYLY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":757564,"name":"AwesomeWare Digital Meat, Multi33, Glod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HtRvxX-LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tired of going back and forthing from indoors to outdoors to check up your meat in a BBQ party?Regret of not taking off the meat at the right time?Always rush around cooking family dinner on holidays like Christmas or Thanksgiving?Don't worry, our 👉Chefmos Wireless Remote Digital BBQ Thermometer👈 is your Perfect Choice to accurately monitor your meat remotely and let you cook like a MASTER every time! Enjoy a fantastic journey of food and fire with us NOW!Advantages To Choose Our Chefmos Instant Read BBQ Grill Thermometer:·Hassle-Free Setup: No synch required. Wirelessly controlled.·Dual Probes Technology: Measure and monitor temperatures of two pieces of meat or two sections of the same large piece of meat or temp in the grill/oven/smoker simultaneously, remotely up to 230 Feet away·Large & Backlit LCD Display: Instant & easy to read the accurate temp·User-friendly Appearance Design: Covered in a Rubber sleeve case to make less slippy.Smart hole, stand and strong magnet to place flexibly·Programmed with preset USDA approved temperatures for different types of meats (Program,Beef,Lamb,Veal,Hamburger,Pork,Turkey,Chick and Fish)·Programmed with preset USDA approved doneness levels for different types of meats (Rare,Med Rare,Medium,Med Well,Well)·Set your own temperature settings manually to suit different types of meats or food·Countdown and countup timer within 10hrs·Wide Usage: Indoor/Outdoor BBQ, Grill, Oven, Smoker for BBQ grilling, kitchen cooking or baking.Specifications:-Remote Range: ≤230 ft. (≤70 m)-Temperature Range: -4 ~ 572℉ (-20℃ ~ 300℃)-Highest Resistant Temperature (Probe): 716℉/380℃-Range of Temperature Error: ±2℉ (±1℃)-Timing Range: 0:00′00″~ 9:59′59″","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HtRvxX-LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AwesomeWare","source_asin":"B016ODU2B8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016ODU2B8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016ODU2B8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
