window.products.push({"id":757662,"name":"AECHY Extra Large Silicone Mat 36”x24”x0.08”, Multipurpose Silicone Mat Thick Heat Resistant Mat Shipped Rolled Up Kitchen Counter Mat Waterproof Nons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QHDVP5okL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ROLL UP AND SHIP 】: AECHY silicone kitchen counter mat packaging is upgraded from folding to rolling, in order to provide customers with a better experience. You will no longer suffer from mat crease. The 36”x24”x0.08” extra large silicone mat is big enough to meet your needs about protecting all size countertop. One dollar coin thickness, up to twice as thick as regular silicone craft mat. The mat lay flat without any wrinkle, stronger and more durable. 【HEALTHY, FOOD GRADE】: The kitchen counter protector is made of food grade silicone which can directly contact food. Safe, odorless, kid and baby use friendly. It is environmental and reusable. Heat resistant between -40°F to 482°F. Protect countertops against the heat of kitchen appliances like microwave, toaster, air fryer and oven, and reduce the noise from vibration while the appliance is in use. 【WATERPROOF & ANTI-SLIP】: The smooth side face up be suggested, as it is not sticky and very easy to clean. Heat resistant silicone mats can be wiped directly with a rag and be washed with soapy water. Spilled resin/glue/paint solidification can be peeled off straightly. We suggest the side with particles face down, as the particles could hold the flat surface tight and helps contain the mess your kid makes from eating or playing. 【A MUST-HAVE MAT】: Our extra large silicone counter mat are widely used for home, kitchen, office, classroom, outdoor, baby, pet and any occasion. Can be used as countertop mat, table mat, pastry mat, placement mat, heat resistant mat, craft mat, pet feeding mat or a baby pad etc. Table protector, mat for crafts, jewelry, casting moulds and other DIY tools and materials. It’s cuttable to fit different sizes and shapes. 【EASY STORAGE, PRACTICAL GIFT】: AECHY premium thick silicone mat with good flexibility, soft and not easy to deform or tear up. Rolls up for easy storage when not in use. Silicone placemats will not occupy the space of your home at all. The colors are graceful and all-match. Just a thoughtful and practical gift for housewarming, weddings and so on!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QHDVP5okL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AECHY","source_asin":"B0BDMS27BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDMS27BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDMS27BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
