window.products.push({"id":757692,"name":"Under NY Sky Knife Bag - Black Real Leather - 13 Knife Slots, 2 Zipped Pockets for Kitchen Utensils, Large Pocket for Tablets & Notebooks - Expandable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N+uGyAsjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STURDY LEATHER CONSTRUCTION, EXCLUSIVE DESIGN – This Knife-Bag allows you to have your tools available and at-sight when you need. It permits the bag to expand freely without compromising the security or safety of your belongings. When in transit, everything stays in place, fastened with high-quality, resistant buckles - easy to open and close when you need. All constructed with Full Grain Brazilian Leather, lined with durable twill, reinforced with double stitchings for maximum durability. 13 POCKETS, BIG STORAGE SPACE – It fits a whole set of culinary tools with 13 pockets for knives and kitchenware, 2 zipped leather pouches for cutlery and personal belongings, 1 zipped laptop pocket and plenty of internal space for whatever you need: knives, clever, tasting spoons, tweezers, thermometer, bottle opener, spatulas, tongs, sharpening stones, ladles, spices, cutting board, but also tablet, pen, wallet, phone, charger, business cards, notebook, clothes, shoes and much more! IT FITS EVERYTHING YOU NEED - The Bag is 12\" wide x 14\" tall (30 x 36 cm) closed and 37\" wide x 30\" tall (94 x 76 cm) fully opened, with 20L volume capacity. It has many pocket, in many different sizes (length x width): Three Pockets of 5.8 x 2 in / 14 x 5 cm, Four Pockets of 5.8 x 2.8 in / 14 x 6.5 cm, Five Pockets of 4.3 x 2 in / 10 x 5 cm, One Pocket of 5.8 x 4 in / 14 x 10 cm. Two Zipped Pouches of 5 x 10 in / 13 x 25.5 cm, One Zipped Laptop Pocket of 14.8 x 11 in / 37 x 28 cm. EASY TO CARRY – Our knife bag comes with a handle and adjustable padded shoulder strap for your preferred method of transport. Perfect to carry your money-making tools whitout calling the attention of a knife-roll, so no one will know the expensive knives you’re carrying inside. Whether you are a head or sous chef, line cook, barbecue master, or the student apprentice starting out, our bag offers all culinary professionals the best solution to safely transport the valued tools of their trade. WE STAND 100% BEHIND OUR PRODUCT – In the unlikely possibility you don't like your bag, just send it back and we'll refund your purchase, hassle-free. 100% REAL REVIEWS - DIFFERENT FROM THE COMPETITION, UNDER NY SKY DOESN'T BUY, PAY, OR ASK FOR FAKE REVIEWS. CHECK IT OUT AND COMPARE. ALWAYS USE SHEATHS TO PROTECT YOUR KNIVES BEFORE PUTTING THEM AWAY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N+uGyAsjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Under NY Sky","source_asin":"B08H2K5D56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H2K5D56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H2K5D56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
