window.products.push({"id":757798,"name":"Pack of 8 Bag Clips, Stainless Steel and Heavy Duty Metal Bag Clip,Tightly Seals Chip, Coffee, Bread or Cereal Bags to Keep Food Fresh, for Home, Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718PwBz8UHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BETTER STORAGE FOR YOUR FOOD: Don’t leave your uneaten bag of potato chips or wheat bread out in the open, allowing air and other germs to contaminate it. Use our heavy duty chip and bag clips and keep your food fresh and safe to eat. Premium-Quality Material: Made from 304 stainless steel, these bag clips will not rust easily, guaranteed to last longer than other clips made from plastic. Shiny finish creates a clean, classic look. STRONG WIDE CLAMP: 3-inch wide clamp is suitable for any size of food bags and keeps a firm, air tight grip. Remember to keep them away from small children as these clamps have a strong clamping force. HIGHLY VERSATILE : Our metal bag clips not only keep your food bags sealed tightly but you can also use them in different ways. These clips can cater to other home and office needs and can be used as clothespins, paper binders, money clips or even for hanging DIY photo wall decorations. OUR SERVICE: No one is born to be a good cook, but good kitchenware often gets twice the result with half the effort. Bundlepro is a trusted kitchen utensil expert, we have been committed to providing customers with the highest quality kitchen utensils. If you have any questions about our products, please dont hesitate to contact us, we will be very happy to serve you !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718PwBz8UHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUNDLEPRO","source_asin":"B098L65RCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098L65RCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098L65RCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
