window.products.push({"id":757881,"name":"Gifts for New Year's Day Pampas Grass,9 PCS Dried Pampas Grass with Sunflower Necklace,18 inch Dried Flower Bouquet for Boho Decor Natural Pampas Gras","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kjByNwyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Real Touch for Pampas Grass:The no bad smell dried flowers are made from 100％ natural great quality pampas grass.The natural pampas grass can be better preserved after being processed by our technology,and the preservation time can reach one year or more. And it is a natural pampas grass,so the touch is real and there is no strange smell.Our faux plant look realistic and gorgeous,easy to clean and don’t fade. Sunflower Necklace:Sunflower symbolize optimism,warmth and sunshine,so this sunflower necklace also can represent loyalty.Our sunflower necklace are innovative in design and show the charm of women.This necklace is very versatile and is suitable for women of all ages,outfits and occasions.This sunflower necklace is perfect as a gift for women and they will be delighted when they receive it. Thanksgiving Gifts for Women: Thanksgiving is coming,are you still struggling with what gift to give your mother?Our dried pampas grass with sunflower necklace is perfect as a gift for mother.The dried pampas grass can be used as a dried flower bouquet to decorate a room and create a romantic atmosphere for the room.Sunflower necklace are very versatile and suitable for women of all ages.No matter what the occasion is with this necklace,it will show the charm of women. Perfect Size for Reed Grass:Set of 9 stems Natural Dried Pampas Grass per pack.Each Pampas grass length is 46.6 inch,natural dried flowers do not need daily care and pruning,which is suitable for decoration in all seasons.Our dried pampas grass can be used as shooting props to shoot natural blockbusters.If you think stems are too long, you can also cut off the stems of the pampas to make our dried pampas grass fit in your vase. Home Decor:Our dried pampas grass bouquets are so beautiful and realistic,so it is a wonderful way to decorate your wedding with our fluffy pampas grass.It’s great for wedding centerpieces,wedding arches or decorating wedding head table backdrops.You can also put dried pampas grass in front of the windowsill,so that when the breeze blows,the pampas leaves will shake gently,adding an artistic atmosphere to living environment. Tips for Pampas Grass:Due to shipping issues,our dried pampas grass may be squashed when they arrive,you can leave the phragmites communis in the sun for a few hours and our dried pampas grass will fluff up again.Do not shake heavily otherwise your plume will fall off.You can also spray some hairspray on the pampas grass to keep the dried plants from shedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kjByNwyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samdray","source_asin":"B098DGP3N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098DGP3N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098DGP3N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
