window.products.push({"id":757936,"name":"Drink Mixer with Double Spring Spiral Durable Stainless Steel Whisk Milk Frother Electric Handheld Foamer Maker for Coffee, Latte, Cappuccino, Hot Cho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oEZd1Di3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Specification Easy to use: Single on / off button. Push the button once to keep the Spinning spiral. You do not need to hold the button during the entire foam process. Once you feel your drink gets frothed enough, the button again, the spinning stops immediately. Easy to clean: Dip the spiral and the front of the rod with hot soapy water and let the Foamer Run for a few seconds. Rinse with clean water. Easy to save: Just turn on the One Touch Control and do all the work for you. All you need to do is Hold It. Compact design that can be stored in the drawer and used daily without having to take up valuable counter space. Portable and traveler-friendly: Works well with cold or hot milk, coffee, cappuccino, hot chocolate, tea, cocktail or espresso coffee blend. Keeps your morning calm and quiet while you create your coffee milk frother masterpieces. Powerful motor creates a smooth and delicate that you've always wanted to cream just take 15 - 20 seconds. Usage Tips 1. Take the hot or cold milk in a cup and plunge the frother half way down. 2. Press the milk frother switch, the whisk will start to run and make foam. 3. When the milk is frothy enough, let go of the switch to stop the whisk running. 4. Please remember to turn off the milk frother switch before lifting the whisk out of the milk to avoid spraying the liquid everywhere. 5. If you would like to make hot milk froth, the temperature of the milk should not be over 60℃/140℉, otherwise, the milk will not froth up perfectly. Features Battery-operated: 3 x 1.5V AAA alkaline batteries ( not include )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oEZd1Di3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATX","source_asin":"B08F7FZDWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7FZDWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7FZDWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
