window.products.push({"id":757984,"name":"Wall Mount Hair Tool Organizer | Elegant Curling Iron Holder for Hair Dryer, Curling Iron & Hair Straightener | Flower Design Hair Dryer Holder for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MR6VdpNtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PERFECT HOME FOR ALL YOUR HAIR TOOLS: The Wiser Key Hair Tool Holder features a smart design that can hold up to 3 different hair care tools with utmost ease. Perfect for hair dryer holder, curling iron holder, hair straightener or any of your favorite hot hair styling tools, no matter their size or shape. WALL MOUNTED HAIR DRYER HOLDER TO DECLUTTER YOUR COUNTERTOPS: Thanks to its space saving, compact and practical design, our wall-mount blow dryer holder will help you keep your bathroom counter clean, neat and tidy at all times. No more messy cords and cluttered vanities. A great addition even to the smallest bathrooms that will maximize your storage space right on the spot! DURABLE METAL CONSTRUCTION FOR YOUR SAFETY: Hot styling tools can easily leave a mark on your vanity or even damage other products that may come in touch with their hot surfaces. Yet, this amazing hair tool organizer will keep everything securely in place to prevent any potential accidents, dents and scratches. Plus, metal hair dryer holder wall mounted durable metal quality can withstand short term temperature! ELEGANT FLOWER DESIGN – BEAUTY & PRACTICALITY COMBINED: Featuring a charming flower pattern with 3 discreet slots for your hot hair tools, this stunning hair care organizer makes a beautiful addition to any bathroom or vanity area that is sure to make the best impressions. Available in two stunning colors, you can definitely find the perfect fit that will match your home décor! A UNIQUE GIFT IDEA FOR ANYONE IN YOUR LIFE: We all know that person that could use some extra organizing supplies. Doubling as a stunning bathroom wall décor ornament, the Wiser Key small bathroom storage organizer makes an out-of-the-box gift idea for your best friends, girlfriend, mother, sister or any other hair tool connoisseur!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MR6VdpNtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wiser Key","source_asin":"B09N9SLT4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N9SLT4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N9SLT4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":757985,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Old World Map Purple Gray by Wild Apple Portfolio, 16x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xbsaykMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a textured purple world map on a grey background. Prominent Colors: White, Grey, Pink Wild Apple Portfolio Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xbsaykMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07NFJYWMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-757985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NFJYWMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NFJYWMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
